diff --git a/docs/api/sections/reactions.md b/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
index 0caa20f..b8369bb 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/reactions.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Reactions
 
-Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments.
+Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to cards or comments.
 
 ## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`
 
@@ -56,3 +56,23 @@ Removes your reaction from a comment.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Card reactions
+
+Card reactions use the same response format and permissions as comment reactions, but are addressed directly on the card.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Returns a list of reactions on a card.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Adds a reaction to a card. The request and response are the same as for comment reactions.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id`
+
+Removes your reaction from a card.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
